{"id": "EUVD-2026-92106", "enisaUuid": "b3dafe5a-0c9b-3a34-9c04-1a5e508b0a97", "description": "ZITADEL 4.x before 4.17.1 does not check an organization's inactive state during Login V2 authentication, verifying only the individual user's status. Users of a deactivated organization who hold valid credentials, an existing session, or a refresh token can still sign in, create sessions, and obtain or refresh tokens.", "datePublished": "2026-10-04T13:10:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-05T15:42:12", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/zitadel/zitadel/security/advisories/GHSA-558c-v5wc-9w4q", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/zitadel-before-4.17.1-authentication-bypass-via-login-v2-for-deactivated-organizations"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-105213", "GHSA-3fc9-77fj-j3c7"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "cd664d73-cbe7-38a2-8581-f86c59d619c0", "product": {"name": "zitadel", "vendor": {"name": "zitadel"}}, "product_version": "0 <4.17.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "37aa54e1-f30a-34e4-a2a1-947d0f1aec22", "vendor": {"name": "zitadel"}}], "isExploited": false}